course: dictionary
lesson: 2967
title: Drowsy and sleepy feelings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Drowsy means sleepy. You feel drowsy when your eyes feel heavy and you could easily fall asleep. You might feel drowsy after a big lunch or late at night.
explain: Drowsy can also describe a place or time. The Mole is drowsy in the boat, and he says the wind in the reeds is «like music—far away music». The word shows that the afternoon is quiet and slow, and that it makes you want to sleep.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it in. «The Mole felt sleepy in the boat» still makes sense, so drowsy means sleepy here. On a medicine label, drowsiness is a warning that the medicine may make you feel sleepy.
fact: Drowsy means sleepy, with heavy eyes and a feeling that you could easily fall asleep.
fact: «Drowsy» can also describe a quiet, slow place or time, such as a warm summer afternoon.
fact: Drowsiness is the noun for the feeling, and «drowsily» is the adverb, which describes how someone does something.
fact: Some medicines can make you drowsy, so the label warns you not to drive or use machines.
fact: «Drowsy driving» is dangerous, because a sleepy driver may not stay alert on the road.
exercise: Drowsy in the boat, the Mole says the wind in the reeds is «like music—far away music». What does drowsy mean here? | *Sleepy and relaxed | Loud and noisy | Cold and wet | Wide awake and excited
exercise: On a medicine label, «may cause drowsiness» means what? | It may make your hair grow | It may make you very hungry | *It may make you feel sleepy | It may make you dance
exercise: Which word is the noun for the feeling of being drowsy? | *drowsiness | drowsily | drowsy | drowsier
test: Which word means the same as drowsy in «I feel drowsy after lunch»? | *Sleepy | Lively | Hungry | Angry
test: What is the adverb form of drowsy? | Drowsing | *Drowsily | Drowsiness | Drowsier
exam: Why is drowsy driving dangerous? | Because roads are always quiet | Because drowsy means happy | Because the car gets too hot | *Because a sleepy driver could fall asleep at the wheel
